{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43701","headline":"句 · 陈贶","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年年闻尔者，未有不伤情。\n出得风尘者，合知岐路人。\n拂榻灯未来，开门月先入。\n忽生云是匣，高以月爲台。\n入夜虽无伤物意，向明还有动人心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈贶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43701.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43701","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}